# The version of the composite plugin is a digest of these files (buildLogicVersion() in
# settings.gradle.kts). Git on Windows checks out text files with CRLF by default. That
# changes the digest, and the build then finds no plugin in composite/m2. Keep these files
# at LF on every computer.
#
# Do not use a rule for all files here. The two gradlew.bat files are in the repository
# with CRLF, so such a rule makes the tree dirty, and a dirty tree gets a -dev version.
/composite/build.gradle.kts text eol=lf
/composite/gradle.properties text eol=lf
/composite/settings.gradle.kts text eol=lf
/composite/src/main/** text eol=lf

# Font files are binary data. Do not let Git change their bytes.
*.ttf binary

# The schema file of SQLDelight (core/store/src/commonMain/sqldelight/databases/1.db) is binary.
*.db binary
